course: dictionary
lesson: 10032
title: Tenth: order, part, and place
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Tenth is a number word for position. It comes after ninth, so it is number 10 in order: the tenth floor is the one after the ninth floor.
explain: A tenth is also one of ten equal parts of a whole, written 1/10 or 0.1. «About seven tenths of the Earth's surface is covered by water» means seven of every ten equal parts, written 7/10 or 0.7.
explain: To find one tenth of a number, divide it by 10. «Take a tenth of the bill and double it; for a $40 bill a tenth is $4» works because 40 divided by 10 is 4.
explain: In decimals, the tenths place is the first digit after the decimal point. In 0.3 the 3 is 3 tenths. «A tenth of a second» in a race is written 0.1 of a second.
fact: Tenth means number 10 in order, coming after ninth.
fact: A tenth is one of ten equal parts of a whole: 1/10 or 0.1.
fact: To find a tenth of a number, divide it by 10.
fact: The tenths place is the first digit after the decimal point: 0.3 is 3 tenths.
fact: «About nine tenths of an iceberg is hidden below the sea» means 9/10 or 0.9 of it is under the water.
exercise: What is a tenth of 80? | *8 | 10 | 0.8 | 80
exercise: Which number is 3 tenths? | *0.3 | 0.03 | 3.0 | 30
exercise: «About seven tenths of the Earth's surface is covered by water.» What does seven tenths mean? | 70 out of 10 equal parts | *7 out of 10 equal parts | 7 out of 100 equal parts | Seven whole Earths
test: Which number is the tenth one when you count from 1? | *10 | 100 | 9 | 1
test: A bill is $50. What is a tenth of the bill? | $10 | $0.50 | *$5 | $500
exam: «A Venus flytrap shuts in about a tenth of a second.» How do you write a tenth of a second as a decimal? | 10 | 0.01 | *0.1 | 1.0
